  "label": "UglyDolls Franchise",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world knowledge that 'UglyDolls' is a fictional franchise created by the studio DreamWorks Animation, which intentionally designs its characters to be visually unattractive as a form of subversion of traditional beauty standards. The franchise's premise is to celebrate 'ugliness' as a positive trait, which contrasts with the meme's text that frames ugliness as a negative, burdensome condition. Understanding this context is necessary to interpret the irony or contradiction in the meme.",
